<concept deliveryTarget="except_print" importance="optional" id="t00361">
	<title>Ambient lights</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords/>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>The ambient lights are installed in the front instrument panel, front doors, and the top/bottom of the center console.</p>
		<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc_none" id="e01534">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="1" colwidth="53*"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="47*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="1" colsep="0">
							<fig id="e01535">
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/N_CT25C009.eps" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<section>
			<title>Operation</title>
			<p>When the vehicle is in <term translate="no">ON</term> position, select <menucascade><uicontrol>Settings</uicontrol><uicontrol>Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Lights</uicontrol><uicontrol>Ambient lighting</uicontrol></menucascade> on the infotainment system.</p>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>